## 1. Dataset & protocols

| Split | Period | Flights (usable) | Intervals |
|-------|--------|-----------------:|----------:|
| Train | Apr–Aug 2025 | 10,000 | 119,032 |
| Rank | Sep 2025 | 1,888 | 24,158 |
| Final | Oct 2025 | 2,824 (after feature build) | **37,170** |

| Protocol | Definition | Typical use |
|----------|------------|-------------|
| **Flight Final** | RMSE on Final holdout only | Deploy / architecture research |
| **Combined** | RMSE(concat Rank, Final) | PRC-style parity |
| **Type-macro** | Mean of per-type RMSE for types with **n ≥ 50** | Entity-level robustness |
| **Body-macro** | Mean of per-body RMSE (heavy / narrow; min n) | Body-class robustness |

**Distillation KD default (after sweep):** α = **0.1**, β = **0.9**, seed **42**, flight-level val fraction **0.2**.

**Frozen deploy student:** Large MLP · `results/distillation/capacity_scaling/runs/Large_seed42/best_model.pt`

---

## 2. Teacher gap-closing ladder

**Teacher type:** 6× GBDT bases (XGB/LGBM/CatBoost × Direct + Fuel-Flow) + Ridge meta + P1E phase affine.

| Version | Variant | Combined RMSE | Δ vs 228.25 |
|---------|---------|--------------:|------------:|
| v1.0 | Official frozen V4 ensemble | **228.25** | reference |
| v1.1 | P1E + P2 Cat heavy specialist | 227.44 | −0.81 |
| R1 | + OpenAP descriptors in heavy specialist | 226.19 | −2.06 |
| R2 | Descriptor fixes (B744/B77L/A306) + R2 features | 225.25 | −3.00 |
| **R3** | **P1E + dynamic mass (21 features)** | **221.33** | **−6.92** |

### Frozen R3 teacher (canonical)

| Metric | Value |
|--------|------:|
| Rank RMSE | **232.53** |
| Final RMSE (official R3 run) | **213.73** |
| Final RMSE (held-out audit / student parity) | **213.62** |
| **Combined RMSE** | **221.33** |
| Combined bias | **+3.85** |
| Heavy RMSE | **416.1** |
| Narrow RMSE | **75.0** |

Canonical v1 Combined 95% CI **[207.1, 249.4]** — does not exclude published winner ~201 → no superiority claim.

