## 7. FT-Transformer experiment

**Scripts:** `08_train_ft_transformer.py`, `09_eval_ft_transformer.py`  
**Config:** d_token=192, n_blocks=3, n_heads=8, attn drop=0.2, FFN drop=0.1  
**Tokens:** 61 = 1 CLS + 56 numeric + 4 categorical  
**Params:** **1,458,625**  
**KD:** α=0.1, β=0.9  
**Checkpoint:** `results/distillation/ft_transformer/ft_transformer_kd1/`

| Metric | FT | Large | Winner |
|--------|---:|------:|--------|
| Val RMSE | 236.08 | 229.70 | Large |
| **Final RMSE** | **224.12** | **215.85** | **Large** |
| **Combined RMSE** | **233.35** | **225.95** | **Large** |
| Type-macro | **261.15** | 270.61 | **FT** |
| Body-macro | 249.58 | **239.63** | **Large** |
| CPU ms | 9.59 | **0.26** | Large |

**Decision:** FT is **not** the deployment model; retained as architecture comparison under type-macro.

