## 8. Phase 0 — Distribution shift

**Script:** `experiments/08_distillation/10_distribution_shift_diagnosis.py`  
**Report:** `docs/reports/distribution_shift_diagnosis.md`

### Protocol table

| Protocol | Teacher | Large | XLarge | FT |
|----------|--------:|------:|-------:|---:|
| Flight Final RMSE | 213.62 | 215.85 | 218.59 | 224.12 |
| Type-macro RMSE | 256.79 | 270.61 | 276.01 | **261.15** |
| Body-macro RMSE | 237.55 | **239.63** | 242.08 | 249.58 |
| Gap vs teacher (flight) | 0 | +2.23 | +4.96 | +10.50 |
| Gap vs teacher (type-macro) | 0 | **+13.82** | +19.22 | **+4.35** |

### Rankings

| Protocol | Order (best → worst among students) |
|----------|-------------------------------------|
| Flight Final | Large > XLarge > FT |
| Type-macro | **FT > Large > XLarge** |
| Body-macro | Large > XLarge > FT (no FT win) |

**Gate:** Adaptive KD unblocked (Large type-macro gap widens by **+11.59 kg** vs flight gap; CI excludes 0 in phase report).

