## 10. Phase 1B — VGKD

**Scripts:** `12_train_vgkd.py`, `13_eval_vgkd.py`  
**Form:** β(x) = β_base · exp(−λ · max(u_n, 0)) or linear variants; architecture = Large MLP  
**Report:** `docs/reports/vgkd_results.md`  
**Artifacts:** `results/distillation/vgkd/`

### Full evaluation table

| Run | Final RMSE | Type-macro | Body-macro | Combined |
|-----|----------:|-----------:|-----------:|---------:|
| **fixed_kd_large (deploy)** | **215.85** | **270.61** | **239.63** | **225.95** |
| static_beta0.7 | 218.87 | 280.82 | 242.43 | 228.71 |
| static_beta0.8 | 216.45 | 273.79 | 240.01 | 226.18 |
| static_beta0.9 | 216.10 | 269.76 | 239.54 | 226.16 |
| **vgkd_exp_lam0.0** (preferred adaptive class) | **216.10** | **269.76** | **239.54** | **226.16** |
| vgkd_exp_lam0.25 | 227.79 | 296.98 | 251.40 | 237.82 |
| vgkd_exp_lam0.5 | 231.30 | 302.10 | 255.06 | 241.27 |
| vgkd_exp_lam1.0 | 232.92 | 301.05 | 257.01 | 240.37 |
| vgkd_exp_lam2.0 | 236.85 | 315.53 | 261.32 | 243.83 |
| vgkd_lin_lam0.25 | 234.04 | 309.76 | 257.77 | 246.04 |
| vgkd_lin_lam0.5 | 237.39 | 314.01 | 261.17 | 244.69 |
| vgkd_lin_lam1.0 | 237.74 | 315.95 | 262.55 | 245.12 |
| vgkd_lin_lam2.0 | 240.88 | 326.58 | 265.99 | 247.45 |
| vgkd_oracle_lam1.0 | 242.16 | 322.53 | 267.68 | 248.60 |
| vgkd_random_lam1.0 | 218.64 | 275.10 | 241.84 | 229.24 |

**Preferred VGKD config:** `vgkd_exp_lam0.0` (equivalent to fixed β=0.9)  
**Conclusion:** λ>0 **worsens** Final and type-macro. **Do not deploy VGKD.**  
**Hypothesis H1 (uncertainty adaptive KD):** **Rejected** as robustness fix.

