## 11. Phase 2 — Transformer robustness

**Script:** `experiments/08_distillation/14_transformer_robustness_analysis.py`  
**Mode:** Analysis only (frozen Large + FT)  
**Report:** `docs/reports/transformer_robustness_analysis.md`

| Evidence | Large | FT |
|----------|------:|---:|
| Final RMSE | **215.85** | 224.12 |
| Type-macro | 270.61 | **261.15** |
| Type silhouette | **+0.038** | −0.014 |
| Rare→common centroid (raw) | 21.8 | **7.0** |
| Mean \|err\| Δ on rare (FT−Large) | — | **≈ −16.5 kg** |
| Mean \|err\| Δ on heavy (FT−Large) | — | **≈ −11.5 kg** |
| Narrowbody Δ (FT−Large) | — | **≈ +0.6 kg** (Large better) |
| Physics-like attribution share | **~0.64** | ~0.38 |
| Attribution agreement (Spearman) | **≈ 0.55** | (vs each other) |
| FT top numeric emphasis | — | **duration_s ~41%** |

**Conclusion:** Geometry/attribution **differ**; not yet a causal proof of ranking reversal.

