## 12. Phase 3 — Mechanism validation

**Scripts:** `15_train_physics_ablation.py`, `16_mechanism_validation.py`  
**Report:** `docs/reports/mechanism_validation.md`  
**Physics features removed:** **33** (OpenAP/mass/energy/`r3_*`); retained **27** non-physics features.

### A1/A2 — Physics ablation

| Model | Full Final | No-phys Final | Δ Final | Full type-macro | No-phys type-macro | Δ type-macro |
|-------|-----------:|--------------:|--------:|----------------:|-------------------:|-------------:|
| Large | 215.85 | 219.49 | **+3.64** | 270.61 | 269.67 | **−0.94** |
| FT | 224.12 | 225.17 | **+1.05** | 261.15 | 263.70 | **+2.55** |

Val RMSE (train): Large nophysics **230.98** · FT nophysics **238.97**

**Ranking without physics (type-macro):** FT 263.70 still **better** than Large 269.67.

### A3 — Type-level correlations (n = 15 types)

| Relation | Pearson | Spearman | p (Spearman) |
|----------|--------:|---------:|-------------:|
| Physics RMSE → **FT advantage** | −0.246 | **−0.100** | **0.723** |
| Physics RMSE → Large RMSE | 0.932 | **0.850** | **6×10⁻⁵** |
| Physics RMSE → FT RMSE | 0.942 | **0.907** | **3×10⁻⁶** |
| log train n → FT advantage | −0.289 | −0.321 | 0.243 |

### A4 — Attribution shares (grad×input, numeric)

| Subgroup | Large physics | FT physics | Large traj | FT traj |
|----------|--------------:|-----------:|-----------:|--------:|
| all | 0.676 | 0.405 | 0.228 | 0.498 |
| heavy | 0.732 | 0.466 | 0.191 | 0.457 |
| narrow | 0.556 | 0.245 | 0.299 | 0.611 |

### B1 — Geometry (scale-normalized)

| Metric | Large | FT |
|--------|------:|---:|
| Rare→common (raw) | 21.80 | 7.02 |
| Rare→common (**norm**) | **0.681** | **0.524** |
| Within-type proxy | 23.68 | 9.18 |
| Inter-type centroid mean | 32.01 | 13.41 |

### B2–B4

| Metric | Large | FT |
|--------|------:|---:|
| Rare→common NN dist | 7.691 | 1.940 |
| Neighbor same-body frac | **0.887** | 0.694 |
| Type purity (k=10) | 0.929 | 0.923 |
| Rel. emb. move (ε=0.05, Phase 3 all-feat noise) | 0.056 | 0.014 |

### B5 — Geometry vs robustness

| Relation | Spearman | p |
|----------|---------:|--:|
| FT centroid dist → FT type RMSE | **0.600** | **0.018** |
| FT centroid dist → **FT advantage** | 0.086 | 0.761 |

### C1 — Variance decomposition of FT advantage (n=15)

| Item | Value |
|------|------:|
| Full R² | **0.654** |
| Unique R² drop: physics_rmse | 0.511 *(coef sign negative — not H-B)* |
| Unique R² drop: centroid_dist | 0.195 |
| Unique R² drop: is_heavy | 0.180 |
| Unique R² drop: log_train_n | 0.017 |

**Conclusions:** H-B physics reliance **rejected**. H-A representation **partially supported**.

