## 13. Phase 3.5 — Smoothness causal intervention

**Script:** `experiments/08_distillation/17_smoothness_causal_intervention.py`  
**Intervention:** `L = L_KD + λ ‖f(x)−f(x+ε)‖²` on continuous features only; σ=0.015 (standardized)  
**λ ∈ {0.01, 0.1, 1.0}** · select by **val RMSE**  
**Report:** `docs/reports/smoothness_causal_intervention.md`

| Model | Val RMSE | Final | Type-macro | Body-macro | Rel. emb. move (cont. ε=0.05) |
|-------|---------:|------:|-----------:|-----------:|------------------------------:|
| Large baseline | 229.70 | **215.85** | 270.61 | 239.63 | 0.0170 |
| FT baseline | — | 224.12 | **261.15** | 249.58 | 0.0135 |
| Cons λ=0.01 | 230.01 | 214.46 | **262.39** | 238.11 | 0.0171 |
| **Cons λ=0.1 (selected)** | **229.85** | 216.50 | 268.02 | 240.16 | 0.0162 |
| Cons λ=1.0 | 230.18 | 215.94 | 262.36 | 239.53 | **0.0143** |

| Selected (λ=0.1) Δ vs Large | Value |
|-----------------------------|------:|
| Δ Final | **+0.65** |
| Δ Type-macro | **−2.59** |

**Continuous-only Large/FT smoothness ratio:** ~**1.25×** (Phase 3 all-feature path had ~4×).  
**Outcome:** Pre-registered **C**; smoothness **not established as causal**.  
**No Phase 4 method.**

---

