## 16. Hypothesis outcomes summary

| ID | Hypothesis | Key experiment | Core numbers | Outcome |
|----|------------|----------------|--------------|---------|
| — | Deploy Large under IID | Final + Combined | Final **215.85**, Combined **225.95** | **Supported** (deploy) |
| — | Ranking reverses under type-macro | Phase 0 | Large 270.61 vs FT **261.15** | **Supported** |
| H1 | Uncertainty adaptive KD helps | Phase 1B VGKD | λ>0 Final/type-macro worse | **Rejected** |
| H2 | Physics feature reliance | Phase 3 ablation | Large type-macro Δ **−0.9**; corr(phys, FT adv) **−0.10** | **Rejected** |
| H3 | Representation geometry | Phase 2–3 | rare→common 7.0 vs 21.8; adv ρ **0.09** | **Partial** |
| H4 | Local smoothness causal | Phase 3.5 | selected type Δ **−2.6**; smooth not ↑ | **Not supported** |
| H5 | Attention routing | Attention analysis | best |ρ| vs adv **0.23**; |ρ| vs FT RMSE up to **0.81** | **Rejected** |

---

